# Credentials must never enter the build context. `COPY . .` in the Dockerfile
# copies whatever is left after this file is applied, so anything not excluded
# here is sent to the daemon and lands in a build-stage layer.
#
# These need their own rules: `.env*` matches only the root `.env` family, and
# `*.md` matches only ROOT-level markdown -- Docker patterns are matched against
# the whole path and `*` does not cross a `/`. Verified empirically against a
# throwaway context: before these lines, both `.secrets/cargo-registry-token`
# and `secrets/CPUB_FED_TOKEN_KEYS.md` were copied in, while `README.md` and
# `docs/thing.md` were correctly excluded.
secrets/
.secrets/
**/secrets/
**/.secrets/
*.pem
**/*.pem
*.p12
**/*.p12
*.pfx
**/*.pfx
id_rsa
id_ed25519
**/id_rsa
**/id_ed25519
